# Jace, Telepath Unbound. Bot1's Lotus and three Bolts fill its graveyard to four on turn 1; Jace, cast on turn 3, loots
# on turn 5, makes it five and returns transformed with 5 loyalty. The +1 ("Up to one target creature gets -2/-0 until
# your next turn") is used with Bot2's Ornithopter as its target on turn 5 (power -2, and 0 again once turn 7 begins) and
# with no target on turns 7, 9 and 11, reaching 9 loyalty. On turn 13 the -9 gives Bot1 the emblem: casting a Mox Pearl then
# makes Bot2 (the targeted opponent) mill five cards (32 cards, 6 draws and 7 in hand: 19 in the library, 14 after the
# trigger). Bot2's own spell on turn 14 does not trigger it: the emblem is Bot1's.

